<title>Sync Action Invoker Namespace</title>

The <action>Sync</action> namespace, part of the <link action_invoker.csdoc>Action Invoker</link>, provides actions to interact with <link sync_services.csdoc>synchronization services</link>.

After <link CS_Sync_connect.csdoc>creating</link> a connection to a synchronization service, a <link action_invoker_resource_ids.csdoc>resource ID</link> is returned that identifies the service in subsequent actions until the connection is <link CS_Sync_disconnect.csdoc>closed</link>.


<subheader>Functionality</subheader>

<table 2 header nowrap>
    <cell>Action</cell><cell>Description</cell>
    <cell><action>Sync.connect</action></cell><cell>Connects to a synchronization service, initiating a synchronization session.</cell>
    <cell><action>Sync.disconnect</action></cell><cell>Ends a synchronization session, disconnecting from the service.</cell>
    <cell><action>Sync.syncParadata</action></cell><cell>Synchronizes the events in a <link paradata.csdoc>paradata</link> log with a synchronization service.</cell>
</table>


<seealso action_invoker.csdoc CS_Network.csdoc synchronization.csdoc />
